    {
      "source": "<code>LettucePool</code> and its implementation <code>DefaultLettucePool</code> have been removed without replacement.\nPlease refer to the <a href=\"https://lettuce.io/core/release/reference/index.html#_connection_pooling\">driver documentation</a> for driver native pooling capabilities.\nMethods accepting pooling parameters have been updated.\nThis effects methods on <code>LettuceConnectionFactory</code> and <code>LettuceConnection</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>LettucePool</code> 及其实现类 <code>DefaultLettucePool</code> 已被移除且无替代方案。\n请参考 <a href=\"https://lettuce.io/core/release/reference/index.html#_connection_pooling\">驱动程序文档</a> 以了解驱动程序的本地池化功能。\n接受池化参数的方法已更新。\n此更改影响了 <code>LettuceConnectionFactory</code> 和 <code>LettuceConnection</code> 上的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<em>now requires a <code>Connection</code> instead of <code>Jedis</code> instance</em>",
      "translation": "<em>现在需要 <code>Connection</code> 而不是 <code>Jedis</code> 实例</em>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>AuthenticatingRedisClient</code> has been removed without replacement.\nPlease refer to the <a href=\"https://lettuce.io/core/release/reference/index.html#basic.redisuri\">driver documentation</a> for <code>RedisURI</code> to set authentication data.",
      "translation": "<code>AuthenticatingRedisClient</code> 已被移除且无替代方案。\n请查阅<a href=\"https://lettuce.io/core/release/reference/index.html#basic.redisuri\">驱动程序文档</a>中关于<code>RedisURI</code>的部分，以设置认证数据。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Please read the Jedis <a href=\"https://github.com/redis/jedis/blob/v4.0.0/docs/3to4.md\">upgrading guide</a> which covers important driver changes.",
      "translation": "请阅读 Jedis 的<a href=\"https://github.com/redis/jedis/blob/v4.0.0/docs/3to4.md\">升级指南</a>，其中涵盖了重要的驱动变更。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<em>can be obtained via JedisClientConfiguration</em>",
      "translation": "可通过 JedisClientConfiguration 获取",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<em>can be set via JedisClientConfiguration</em>",
      "translation": "可通过 JedisClientConfiguration 设置",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "This section contains details about migration steps, deprecations, and removals.",
      "translation": "本节包含有关迁移步骤、弃用和移除的详细信息。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "has package visibility now",
      "translation": "现在已支持包可见性。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Pipelining and Transactions are now mutually exclusive.\nThe usage of server or connection commands in pipeline/transactions mode is no longer possible.",
      "translation": "管道和事务现在互斥。  \n在管道或事务模式下，无法再使用服务器命令或连接命令。",
      "count": 1
    },
